/T (It gives us great pleasure in presenting Health Assessment and Performance Prediction in Cloud Environments using Ensemble Modeling as our T.Y. B.Tech. Mini project. Words have never seemed as inadequate as now when we are endeavoring to express our gratitude at the culmination of our T.Y. B.Tech. Mini project to all those who have made it possible. Even the best efforts are waste, without the proper guidance and advice of our project guide Prof. Chiranjit Das for the consistent guidance, co-operation, inspiration, practical approach and constructive criticism, which provided us the much needed impetus to work hard & also thanks Dr. Deepika Ajalkar Head of CSE \(Data Science\) Department for their continuous support & valuable suggestions. We take this opportunity to thank our I/C Director Dr. N. B. Hulle for their whole hearted support, motivation & valuable suggestions. We would also like to thank Prof. Rahul Borate our Mini project Coordinator, for her valuable support in providing us with the required information. At the end, we would like to give special thanks to all staff members from CSE\(Data Science\) of G H Raisoni College of Engineering and Management, Pune & our colleagues for their kind support & timely suggestions. )
/E (It gives us great pleasure in presenting Health Assessment and Performance Prediction in Cloud Environments using Ensemble Modeling as our T.Y. B.Tech. Mini project. Words have never seemed as inadequate as now when we are endeavoring to express our gratitude at the culmination of our T.Y. B.Tech. Mini project to all those who have made it possible. Even the best efforts are waste, without the proper guidance and advice of our project guide Prof. Chiranjit Das for the consistent guidance, co-operation, inspiration, practical approach and constructive criticism, which provided us the much needed impetus to work hard & also thanks Dr. Deepika Ajalkar Head of CSE \(Data Science\) Department for their continuous support & valuable suggestions. We take this opportunity to thank our I/C Director Dr. N. B. Hulle for their whole hearted support, motivation & valuable suggestions. We would also like to thank Prof. Rahul Borate our Mini project Coordinator, for her valuable support in providing us with the required information. At the end, we would like to give special thanks to all staff members from CSE\(Data Science\) of G H Raisoni College of Engineering and Management, Pune & our colleagues for their kind support & timely suggestions. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
