422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 190 0 R
/T (The proposed system is developed to collect raw cloud resource data such as CPU usage, memory consumption, disk utilization, and network activity provided by users, which serves as the input for further analysis and processing. Using this data, the system aims to predict cloud system performance by applying ensemble machine learning models that can estimate future performance behavior more accurately and reliably than a single model. This prediction helps in understanding how the system may perform under different conditions and workloads. In addition to performance prediction, the system also classifies the health status of the cloud system into simple categories such as Normal, Warning, or Critical, allowing users to quickly interpret the condition of their system and take necessary actions. Furthermore, the entire solution is designed as a full-stack stateless system that combines frontend, backend, and machine learning components into a scalable architecture, while avoiding the storage of past user data to maintain simplicity, efficiency, and flexibility.)
/E (The proposed system is developed to collect raw cloud resource data such as CPU usage, memory consumption, disk utilization, and network activity provided by users, which serves as the input for further analysis and processing. Using this data, the system aims to predict cloud system performance by applying ensemble machine learning models that can estimate future performance behavior more accurately and reliably than a single model. This prediction helps in understanding how the system may perform under different conditions and workloads. In addition to performance prediction, the system also classifies the health status of the cloud system into simple categories such as Normal, Warning, or Critical, allowing users to quickly interpret the condition of their system and take necessary actions. Furthermore, the entire solution is designed as a full-stack stateless system that combines frontend, backend, and machine learning components into a scalable architecture, while avoiding the storage of past user data to maintain simplicity, efficiency, and flexibility.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 190 0 R
/T (Cloud computing provides on-demand access to resources like servers, storage, and applications over the internet on a pay-as-you-go basis, enabling services such as email and streaming without managing hardware. Monitoring ensures performance, availability, and security by detecting issues, reducing downtime, and optimizing costs. However, it faces challenges like data security risks, downtime, vendor lock-in, and compliance issues. Machine learning improves cloud systems by predicting workloads, optimizing resources, and detecting failures, making them more efficient and reliable. )
/E (Cloud computing provides on-demand access to resources like servers, storage, and applications over the internet on a pay-as-you-go basis, enabling services such as email and streaming without managing hardware. Monitoring ensures performance, availability, and security by detecting issues, reducing downtime, and optimizing costs. However, it faces challenges like data security risks, downtime, vendor lock-in, and compliance issues. Machine learning improves cloud systems by predicting workloads, optimizing resources, and detecting failures, making them more efficient and reliable. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 190 0 R
/T (Most cloud monitoring systems detect problems only after they happen and depend on stored past data. This makes them slow, complex, and difficult to scale. There is a need for a simple, stateless system that can predict cloud performance in real time and show the overall system health early using machine learning. )
/E (Most cloud monitoring systems detect problems only after they happen and depend on stored past data. This makes them slow, complex, and difficult to scale. There is a need for a simple, stateless system that can predict cloud performance in real time and show the overall system health early using machine learning. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
