1412 0 obj
<<
/Title (To ensure the reliability of the cloud health prediction system, a multi-tiered testing strategy was implemented.The system is tested at multiple levels to ensure proper functionality and accuracy. In unit testing, individual machine learning models such as Random Forest, Gradient Boosting, Decision Tree, and Logistic Regression are validated using controlled inputs to check if they produce correct outputs. During integration testing, Flask API endpoints like /api/predict, /api/classify, and /api/health are tested using tools such as Postman to verify JSON responses, error handling, and HTTP status codes. Finally, system or end-to-end testing involves manually using the frontend dashboard to ensure that user inputs correctly trigger the full prediction and classification process, and that accurate results are displayed to the user.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1406 0 R
>>
endobj
