1442 0 obj
<<
/Title (Cloud computing provides on-demand access to resources like servers, storage, and applications over the internet on a pay-as-you-go basis, enabling services such as email and streaming without managing hardware. Monitoring ensures performance, availability, and security by detecting issues, reducing downtime, and optimizing costs. However, it faces challenges like data security risks, downtime, vendor lock-in, and compliance issues. Machine learning improves cloud systems by predicting workloads, optimizing resources, and detecting failures, making them more efficient and reliable.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1438 0 R
>>
endobj
