1445 0 obj
<<
/Title (Most cloud monitoring systems detect problems only after they happen and depend on stored past data. This makes them slow, complex, and difficult to scale. There is a need for a simple, stateless system that can predict cloud performance in real time and show the overall system health early using machine learning.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1443 0 R
>>
endobj
1446 0 obj
<<
